# Parentify configuration reference.
#
# Non-secret demo defaults live in assets/env.defaults and are checked in.
# Do not create an assets/.env: it is gitignored and not bundled, and a key
# stored in a bundled file can be extracted from the app package.
#
# Supply the Gemini key at build time instead:
#   flutter run --dart-define=GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
#
# Or enter it in the in-app Settings sheet (kept in memory for the session).
#
# Supported --dart-define keys:
#   GEMINI_API_KEY
#   GEMINI_MODEL              (default: gemini-2.5-flash)
#   GEMINI_API_URL            (default: https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta)
#   AI_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
#   AI_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS
#   DEMO_PARENT_EMAIL
#   DEMO_PARENT_PASSWORD
#   DEMO_CHILD_PIN
#   DEMO_MODE                 (false disables demo sign-in even in debug builds)
